        {"zh": "锁定目标，瞄准射击！", "en": "Target locked, aim and shoot!"},
        {"zh": "瞄准目标，准备射击！", "en": "Targeting, prepare to shoot!"},
        {"zh": "我算好你的距离了。", "en": "I have your range worked out."},
        {"zh": "扳机就在我爪下。", "en": "The trigger is under my claw."},
        {"zh": "弩机卡好了，护甲帮你挡不住。", "en": "My crossbow is cocked; armor will not save you."},
        {"zh": "三、二、一，别动。", "en": "Three, two, one, don't move."},
        {"zh": "我的弩架得很稳。", "en": "My crossbow rests steady."},
        {"zh": "你先迈左脚试试。", "en": "Go on, try your left foot."},
        {"zh": "我瞄过的都跑不掉。", "en": "Nothing I've aimed at has escaped."},
        {"zh": "别躲在石头后头。", "en": "Don't hide behind that rock."},
        {"zh": "火药味飘过来了，我闻到。", "en": "The smell of gunpowder drifts over. I smell it."},
        {"zh": "我换一支更重的箭。", "en": "I'm switching to a heavier bolt."}
      ]
